Slow, relentless, and heavily armored, the **Spider Tank** exists for
one thing: destruction. Bristling with weapons, it has no trouble
carrying out its programming. *Armored +3, Attack (Countless Weapons)
+3, Combat Expert +2, Tough +1; Awkward Size (Huge) -3, Clumsy -1,
Emotionless -3, Slow -1, Vulnerability (Electricity) -2.*

